  "description": "The PC half of the NextSync \".sync5 -listen\" Remote Explorer protocol: a TCP server a ZX Spectrum Next (the .sync5 dot, ZX Next Remote's Listener, QLNextRemote) dials into over Wi-Fi, after which this library drives it - list folders, get and put files with the dot's framing, checksums and retries, mkdir/rmdir/rm/rename, drives, free space, the version ident, CRC-32 computed on the Next, release and quit. Ported from ZX-Next-Unite's tested worker. Targets .NET Framework 4.5 and .NET Standard 2.0.",
